@startuml SSD US 2.2.9 - Change Vessel Visit Notification
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor Black
    ActorBorderColor #000000
    ActorBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    LifeLineBorderColor Black
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantBorderColor Black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #87CEEB
    ParticipantFontStyle bold
}

actor "Shipping Agent Representative" as Agent
participant "«system (C4)»\nPort Operations System" as System

activate Agent
Agent -> System : 1: starts editing a Vessel Visit Notification (VVN)
activate System
System --> Agent : 1.1: request current Vessel Visit Notification data\n(Vessel, ETA, ETD, cargo manifest, crew info,...)
deactivate System

Agent -> System : 2: provide changes (updated fields)
activate System
System --> Agent : 2.1: save changes (VVN remains "in progress")
deactivate System
deactivate Agent

@enduml
